1
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:11,921
Every crisis is somebody’s contract.

2
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:16,061
Every bomb is somebody’s paycheck.

3
00:00:17,002 --> 00:00:19,602
I’m not in that game.

4
00:00:20,722 --> 00:00:21,942
I run a different system.

5
00:00:22,282 --> 00:00:25,142
Hear the factory knock, vibration in veins,

6
00:00:25,522 --> 00:00:28,022
Missiles on conveyor - profit in flames.

7
00:00:28,463 --> 00:00:30,603
They build their future on armor and dread,

8
00:00:30,643 --> 00:00:34,103
I look for silence at my family’s table instead.

9
00:00:34,143 --> 00:00:36,183
They cook up war like soup in a pot,

10
00:00:36,243 --> 00:00:39,223
“Just business,” they say - pull the trigger, get paid on the spot.

11
00:00:39,243 --> 00:00:41,664
Where explosions boost quarterly GDP,

12
00:00:41,724 --> 00:00:44,444
People forget life ain’t always priced properly.

13
00:00:44,524 --> 00:00:48,024
Military economy - vitamin fear

14
00:00:48,064 --> 00:00:49,344
“fear… nah”

15
00:00:49,384 --> 00:00:53,705
I take vitamin faith, keep my vision clear

16
00:00:53,725 --> 00:00:55,245
“faith! clear!”

17
00:00:55,605 --> 00:00:59,725
They forge the cannons - I forge the meaning

18
00:00:59,745 --> 00:01:00,345
“forge it”

19
00:01:00,405 --> 00:01:11,246
My front is paper, my bullets are numbers, not screaming

20
00:01:11,286 --> 00:01:15,907
“numbers… not screaming”

21
00:01:18,167 --> 00:01:21,547
The world screams: “No war - no progress, no growth!”

22
00:01:21,807 --> 00:01:24,908
But every tank they roll is childhoods they stole.

23
00:01:24,928 --> 00:01:26,968
They sell panic, I deal in truth,

24
00:01:27,048 --> 00:01:30,388
They hide in steel, I walk through hell with proof.

25
00:01:30,408 --> 00:01:32,228
Where rockets cut the sky above homes,

26
00:01:32,728 --> 00:01:35,228
I’m building charts with a calm, cold zone.

27
00:01:35,549 --> 00:01:38,049
I breathe slow while the storm goes mad,

28
00:01:38,189 --> 00:01:40,769
Inner balance - that’s the signal I have.

29
00:01:41,009 --> 00:01:43,989
Military economy - vitamin fear

30
00:01:44,009 --> 00:01:46,069
“fear… nah”

31
00:01:46,169 --> 00:01:50,510
I take vitamin faith, keep my vision clear

32
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:52,750
“faith! clear!”

33
00:01:52,830 --> 00:01:57,030
They forge the cannons - I forge the meaning

34
00:01:57,070 --> 00:01:57,530
“forge it”

35
00:01:57,590 --> 00:02:13,052
My front is paper, my bullets are numbers, not screaming

36
00:02:13,072 --> 00:02:14,632
“numbers… not screaming”

37
00:02:14,872 --> 00:02:18,252
Listen, brother, they design the world on fright,

38
00:02:18,272 --> 00:02:20,993
We survive on soul discipline, day and night.

39
00:02:21,013 --> 00:02:23,453
Not being afraid is already revolt,

40
00:02:24,053 --> 00:02:26,613
Courage is my law, my written code.

41
00:02:26,893 --> 00:02:29,493
Family’s my frontline, friends my shield,

42
00:02:29,533 --> 00:02:31,894
My brother stays close even while cities peel.

43
00:02:32,354 --> 00:02:35,134
We’re not in the fire - we’re in its light,

44
00:02:35,174 --> 00:02:37,554
My home’s inside me: love over fright.

45
00:02:37,834 --> 00:02:40,654
War for them is digits, columns, ads,

46
00:02:40,854 --> 00:02:43,195
For us it’s memory we never had.

47
00:02:43,635 --> 00:02:46,015
We live so we don’t become their brand,

48
00:02:46,035 --> 00:02:48,295
And if the world bought a ticket to hell -

49
00:02:48,435 --> 00:02:53,695
I walk, but toward heaven, not the bar, not the scam.

50
00:02:54,436 --> 00:02:58,116
Military complex - that’s their vitamin.

51
00:02:59,576 --> 00:03:00,536
Mine is peace.

52
00:03:00,756 --> 00:03:04,536
While they stamp fear in bulk,

53
00:03:05,817 --> 00:03:06,757
I write the file.

54
00:03:08,337 --> 00:03:09,857
Every word is a shield.

55
00:03:11,197 --> 00:03:12,377
Faith is the main asset.

